# Runtime appendix: Svelte 5

The rules are in `00-zones.mdc`, `01-block-root.mdc`, `02-no-raw-html.mdc`,
`03-static-aria.mdc` and `06-fixtures-no-literal-text.mdc`. This file only maps
their terms to Svelte 5 syntax. Files: `*.svelte` inside the composition paths of the
packages whose `ui8kit.runtime` is `svelte` (see `rules/zones.json`).

## Paths

| Zone | Paths |
| --- | --- |
| Kit | `packages/kit/svelte` (UI8Kit 3 primitives); `packages/kit-compose/svelte/src/compose`, `src/icons`, `src/presets`, `src/utils`, `src/styles`; `apps/host-svelte/gen/runtime`; `apps/magazine/src/lib`; `packages/taste-screens/src/recipes` |
| Composition | `packages/kit-compose/svelte/src/blocks`, `src/components`; `apps/host-svelte/gen/screens`; `apps/magazine/src/App.svelte`, `src/reference`, `src/parts`, `src/feed`, `src/templates`; `apps/discovery/src/App.svelte`, `src/parts`; `packages/taste-screens/src/screens`, `src/parts` |

## Syntax

| Term | Forbidden in composition | Use instead |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Raw HTML injection | `{@html markup}` | kit components built from nodes |
| Dynamic tag | `<svelte:element this={tag}>` | a kit primitive with a `tag` prop |
| Raw native tag | `<div>`, `<span>`, `<svg>` and any lowercase element | `Box`, `Text`, `Icon`, ... |
| Reactive ARIA state | `aria-expanded={open}`, `aria-current={on ? "page" : undefined}` | a primitive prop: `<Button pressed={on}>` |
| Two-way binding | `bind:value`, `$bindable` (also `_nonportable.json`) | one-way `value` plus an event prop |
| Literal text | `<Text>Save</Text>`, `label="Save"`, `{ok ? "Yes" : "No"}` | `{ui.group.key}`, `tpl(ui.group.key, { n })`, props |
| Component root | first node of the markup after `<script>`/`<style>`, looking through `{#if}`/`{#each}`/`{#key}`/`{#await}` | |
| One Block per file (rule 01) | two root-level `Block` in the same branch; `Block` inside `{#each}`; `Block` inside `Block` | `{#if}` / `{:else if}` / `{:else}` (and `{#await}` states) may each open on their own single `Block`; any other second `Block` goes to a separate file |
| Block roots (rule 01) | a block or screen file that does not open on `Block`; `Nav`, `Figure`, `Article`, `Header`, `Footer`, `Blockquote` (removed) | any file may open on one `Block` with a semantic tag; a nested or looped `nav` / `figure` / `article` is a separate file rooted on `Block`; quotations and captions are `Text` with `tag` |

Allowed structure: `{#if}`, `{#each}`, `{#await}`, `{#key}`, `{#snippet}`,
`{@render}`, `{@const}`, and the special elements that do not choose a host tag:
`svelte:window`, `svelte:document`, `svelte:body`, `svelte:head`, `svelte:boundary`.
Do not start a `.svelte` file with a `//` comment: the template shows it as text.
